      "message": "In Python, KeyboardInterrupt raised in the main thread during as_completed() will interrupt the main thread, not individual worker futures.\n\nCatching KeyboardInterrupt inside the for future in futures.as_completed(...) block and continuing the loop will swallow Ctrl+C signals, making it difficult for users to stop the test suite cleanly.\n\n\n```\nexcept Exception as e:\n    print(\n        f\"Board {board} test execution failed with exception: {e}\",\n        file\u003dsys.stderr,\n    )\n    success \u003d False\n    ```",
